  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Skills for Employment</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The Action aims to enhance opportunities for Mozambican youth, with a special focus on women, to obtain decent employment, through enhancing the supply and the demand side of the labour market, the transition into the world of work and the enabling framework conditions for employment. Outputs:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;1.Improved labour market orientation of training offers in sectors supporting a green transformation&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;2.Increased competitiveness of start-ups, entrepreneurs and micro, small, and medium enterprises (MSMEs) supporting the green transformation&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;3.Improved transition from education and training to the world of work&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;4.Increased labour market-orientation of Technical and vocational education and training (TVET) and employment policy&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
